use os;

// 2026-08-10: runalways.ecl -- POL's single script that auto-starts once at
// server boot and persists for the shard's lifetime. Was previously an
// inert placeholder (the loop's own Sleep() was commented out, spinning
// with no yield). Now used to kick off the customhousing decay sweep as an
// independent, single, persistent thread rather than one loop per sign (see
// decaywatcher.src for why that design was chosen). Start_Script spawns an
// independent thread that outlives this one; this loop doesn't need to do
// the sweep work itself, and is kept alive (properly sleeping now) as a
// general boot-time dispatch point for anything similar added later.

Start_Script(":customhousing:decaywatcher");

while (1)
    Sleep(600);
endwhile
